en:
Home Assistant now uses httpx2 instead of httpx. The `logger` configuration in your `configuration.yaml` file sets a level or filter for loggers that no longer receive log messages:

{loggers}

Rename them as shown in your `logger` configuration and restart Home Assistant to fix this issue.

sv:
